The flow of battle invigorates you, allowing you to press your advantage as the fight progresses.

Up to once each per turn, while dual wielding, you may:

Riposte — If a melee or archery attack misses you or you parry it, you instantly restore [1.7, 2.6, 3.4, 3.9, 4.4 (TL1-5)] stamina and gain [3%, 7%, 10%, 11%, 13% (TL1-5)] of a turn.

Recover — On performing a critical strike with your offhand weapon, you instantly restore [1.7, 2.6, 3.4, 3.9, 4.4 (TL1-5)] stamina.
